WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,450
A Bampilo is out

2
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:02,450
Class A Ding Feijie

3
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:03,810
Luxiakanti is out

4
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:05,170
Hunting points cleared

5
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:06,450
S disk is responsible for exiting

6
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:07,650
There's nothing we can do about it

7
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,490
Responsibility is the only thing that can last so long.

8
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:10,410
It's already not easy

9
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:17,220
Alas, there is one less person. Class A is here. Something is not right.

10
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:21,740
Are you okay Captain?

11
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:23,300
You guys go first

12
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,300
Don't talk nonsense

13
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,860
How could we leave you?

14
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,700
Listen to me, I can't do it during the day

15
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,020
It will delay your progress

16
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,620
But at night my naihan

17
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:31,700
Have some TV capabilities

18
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,060
All better than you

19
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,500
Continue to tie them together

20
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,930
It's not good for us

21
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:42,510
There's still some brains

22
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:43,430
If you have no water

23
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,550
Or encounter some danger

24
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:46,230
If you can't figure it out yourself, use a warning device.

25
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:49,710
Don't hold on, you know? Captain, I am myself after all.

26
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:50,990
Admitted to Qilin Military Academy

27
00:00:50,990 --> 00:00:52,470
Don't treat me like a child
